      "content": "hey, im working on some market segmentation for a new retail client. they have two very different lines coming out: a premium, high-end organic skincare collection and a basic, budget-friendly line of household cleaning supplies. can you help me build out two detailed consumer personas? i need to know their typical occupation, lifestyle, and cultural background so we can tailor the ad spend. thanks!",
